  "annotated_lines": [
    {
      "id": "V000",
      "text": "我还记得这间会议室。这是专门为特蕾西娅空着的位置吗？不......我并不需要。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "任命助理",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "任命助理",
        "interlocutor": "博士",
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V001",
      "text": "特蕾西娅已经永远离开了，现在留在这里的我，只是一个存在于“魔王”之中的程序。因为阿米娅的情感，我才会以这副模样显现。不要将我当作特蕾西娅，尽管我记得过去的一切。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "交谈1",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "交谈1",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V002",
      "text": "我会陪在阿米娅身边，也会陪着罗德岛的大家，虽然这也算不上对过去时光的补偿......博士，我不是PRTS那样的程序哦，你看，虽然这个身体没有温度，可我也是会笑的。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "交谈2",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "交谈2",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V003",
      "text": "罗德岛跨过了战争，该沿着她原本的航线出发了。就从改善后勤保障做起如何？有几间会议室是不是可以腾出来改成病房呢......征求我的意见？博士，我说过的，不要将我当作特蕾西娅。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "交谈3",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "交谈3",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V004",
      "text": "“罗德岛制药公司”，注册地是阿米娅的故乡呢。这些药物都是凯尔希研制的吗......怎么会遗憾？巴别塔的使命已经完成了，罗德岛会继续航行，治愈病痛。特蕾西娅也一定会很欣慰吧。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "晋升后交谈1",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "晋升后交谈1",
        "interlocutor": "博士",
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "commit",
          "label": "承诺",
          "confidence": 0.8
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V005",
      "text": "我从不后悔曾经的选择。我们做了可以做的一切，然后将希望留给未来。时间会弥合伤口，爱意会抚平疤痕。漫漫长夜后，罗德岛会迎来黎明。许多人在途中离去了，我会留在这里，见证那个结局。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "晋升后交谈2",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "晋升后交谈2",
        "interlocutor": "博士",
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "commit",
          "label": "承诺",
          "confidence": 0.85
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V006",
      "text": "阿米娅看上去还是这么瘦弱，这个年纪的孩子，个子是不是应该更高一点才对？她到底有没有好好吃饭呢......她多想看到阿米娅现在的样子，多想陪她再长大一点。她本该看到的......",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "信赖提升后交谈1",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "信赖提升后交谈1",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "comfort"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "evade",
          "label": "回避",
          "confidence": 0.75
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V007",
      "text": "凯尔希还是不愿与我讲话，向这顶王冠询问的时候，她都在回避我的眼睛。“魔王”记得她的过去，我可以体谅她的孤独，却不能为她解开枷锁。博士，或许有一天，你可以陪她找到存在的意义。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "信赖提升后交谈2",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "信赖提升后交谈2",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "comfort"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V008",
      "text": "博士，你的眼里常怀愧疚。可你说，记忆能够决定一个人是谁吗？失去了记忆的你，和只是拥有她记忆的我，又如何解开那个结呢？多去陪陪阿米娅和凯尔希吧，停留在过去的有她就够了。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "信赖提升后交谈3",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "信赖提升后交谈3",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "comfort"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V009",
      "text": "博士，累了吗？那就休息吧。每个人都有平静入梦的权利，你也一样。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "闲置",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "闲置",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "comfort",
          "label": "安抚",
          "confidence": 0.75
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V010",
      "text": "......我在。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "干员报到",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "干员报到",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "evade",
          "label": "回避",
          "confidence": 0.7
        },
        {
          "type": "presence",
          "label": "存在确认",
          "confidence": 0.9
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V011",
      "text": "......我是不是在作战画面里看到了阿米娅？",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "观看作战记录",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "观看作战记录",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "evade",
          "label": "回避",
          "confidence": 0.7
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V012",
      "text": "我还记得亲手交出去的每一块勋章，这样的仪式也是一种承诺。罗德岛不会放弃理想，不会辜负牺牲，不会遗忘同行的人。我们依然行走在最初所希望的路上。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "精英化晋升1",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "精英化晋升1",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V013",
      "text": "我知道，还有许多人需要我。不用着急，这一次我不会离开了。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "精英化晋升2",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "精英化晋升2",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V014",
      "text": "你会再次带领我们走向胜利吗，博士？",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "编入队伍",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "编入队伍",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V015",
      "text": "我会与罗德岛的战士们站在一起。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "任命队长",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "任命队长",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [
        {
          "type": "commit",
          "label": "承诺",
          "confidence": 0.85
        }
      ],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V016",
      "text": "罗德岛的战士们，愿你们凯旋。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "行动出发",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "行动出发",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V017",
      "text": "我能听到你们所有人的悲伤。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "行动开始",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "行动开始",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V018",
      "text": "博士，我相信你的指挥。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "选中干员1",
      "context": {
        "phase": "babel",
        "scene": "选中干员1",
        "interlocutor": null,
        "preceding_event": "",
        "situation_type": "casual"
      },
      "speech_acts": [],
      "emotion": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "V019",
      "text": "别怕，我在。",
      "source": "voice",
      "source_detail": "选中干员2",
      "context": {
